https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/, with one exception:

  legends/abbreviations.yaml was seeded with evidence from ocre-texts (Neel Smith,
  https://github.com/neelsmith/ocre-texts), whose expanded legends come from Online Coins of the
  Roman Empire (http://numismatics.org/ocre/) under the Open Database License. It is therefore
  licensed under the Open Database License 1.0 (ODbL), https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/.

To credit this work, name Solidi (https://solidi.org) and link to the licence.
